# 1.5.10: Lights Visual (Setup's LIGHTS, 3): the keys follow the video synth's picture across them (lit #, half or
# dim +, off .), changing with it; on a page without the picture, the scale as On
wait 1500
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 5
spin K4 2
listen
where
said Lights Visual
tap HOME
wait 2000
leds
wait 700
leds
wait 700
leds
tap GLO
wait 300
leds
